# **🏗 Core Architecture (Strict Layered Pattern)**

**Request → Route → Controller → Service → Repository → Model → Database**

| Layer          | Responsibility                           | Must NOT Do    |
| -------------- | ---------------------------------------- | -------------- |
| **Route**      | Define endpoints + middleware            | Logic          |
| **Controller** | Handle request/response formatting       | Business logic |
| **Service**    | Business logic layer                     | DB queries     |
| **Repository** | Data access layer (Eloquent abstraction) | Business logic |
| **Model**      | Eloquent ORM only                        | Logic          |
| **Migration**  | Database schema                          | Logic          |

